blog-line--center\">的全国联赛大会</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">首次在香港举办啦！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">而我作为这场活动开幕式的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">神秘嘉宾！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/001-355c91ddbc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/001-355c91ddbc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n从船上看到的是香港岛！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">昨天到达机场后</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">去香港观光啦！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">乘坐了足足要坐20多分钟的长途缆车</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/003-cb2bdda66d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/003-cb2bdda66d.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n参观了巨大的佛像\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/004-770ff433e7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/004-770ff433e7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"360\" height=\"480\"></a></figure>\n\n在能量点沐浴能量\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/005-212809e47e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/005-212809e47e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"617\"></a></figure>\n\n还抓到了伊布（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/006-9049d6bc17.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/006-9049d6bc17.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"358\" height=\"613\"></a></figure>\n\n还抓到了妙蛙草（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n去了市区……\n                <br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/007-943ab0670e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/007-943ab0670e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n像秋叶原一样、卖着好多游戏的街机厅\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/008-d69aa070ce.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/008-d69aa070ce.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还去了电影里经常出现的、印象中的香港地点\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/009-e581f2ef41.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/009-e581f2ef41.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n总之，街上的大楼数量实在惊人！\n\n听说香港没有地震！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/010-0fb5ac6a1f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/010-0fb5ac6a1f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"905\" height=\"423\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n山前就是成片的大楼！自然与建筑的和谐融合！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/012-c32bf39294.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/012-c32bf39294.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n夜景也很美！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n就是这样……\n\n去了几个地方\n\n在香港观光后的第二天\n\n今天\n\n我在大会开幕式上\n\n和皮卡丘一起登台！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/013-bfec35dcf8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/013-bfec35dcf8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n大家介绍了\n\n我去观光的地方！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/014-05f4b5b328.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/014-05f4b5b328.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n还介绍了《宝可梦 太阳／月亮》！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/016-dfe2e4a849.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/016-dfe2e4a849.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/017-4b8ee1a3d6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/4639036/017-4b8ee1a3d6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n还介绍了任天堂香港亲手制作的可达鸭！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n因为工作安排\n                        \n我现在就要回日本了\n                        \n没办法看到大会结束\n\n<br>\n\n\n香港的大家\n请好好享受大会吧！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n下回再见啦！</div>","ma